{"id":"ansicht","lemma":"Ansicht","pos":"noun","rank":3251,"glosses":["view (a depiction of a subject, especially from a specific perspective)","view (a state of the user interface in which data is displayed and arranged in a specific way)","view; opinion"],"ipa":"/ˈʔanzɪçt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9f/De-at-Ansicht.ogg/De-at-Ansicht.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Ansicht","plural":"Ansichten"},"examples":[{"text":"Sind Sie anderer Ansicht?","en":"Do you disagree?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/87800","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"another , others"},null]},{"text":"Ich respektiere deine Ansichten.","en":"I respect your views.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to respect","l":"respektieren"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null]},{"text":"Nach meiner Ansicht bist du schön.","en":"In my opinion, you're beautiful.","words":[{"g":"after / to"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"well, beautifully"}]},{"text":"Ich bin anderer Ansicht.","en":"I disagree.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566580","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"another , others"},null]},{"text":"Du hast deine Ansichten, denke ich, klar gemacht.","en":"I think you've made your point.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"okay!"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]}]}